  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your little secret friend is your failsafe against a lethal attack.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Die for Your Master<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your tumor familiar adds your mythic tier to its Reflex save to intercept an attack that would reduce you to 0 or fewer hit points, and it can intercept a targeted spell or other special ability (including effects that do not deal hit point damage), though not from area effects. Your tumor familiar gains DR/epic equal to twice your mythic tier when it intercepts an attack that was originally targeted at you.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc87\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
